% composition-series: Ontario Listening Bridges — set 1
% composition-grade: 1
% composition-elements: duration (beat versus rhythm, quarter and paired eighths, quarter rest), pitch (mi-so-la), texture (unison ostinato), form (call and response)
% composition-listen: Fela Kuti — "Water No Get Enemy"
% composition-listen-url: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Fela+Kuti+Water+No+Get+Enemy+official
% composition-bridge: Track one repeating part while other layers enter; hear that a groove can stay steady while the surface changes.
% composition-context: Fela Kuti's recording connects Afrobeat with Nigerian political music, long-form ensemble layering and dance. This three-note original is a first ostinato lesson, not an Afrobeat reproduction.
% composition-distance: Original melody, rhythm and words; no horn line, lyric, bass pattern or harmony from the recording is copied.
